{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get ready to enter a network of futuristic puzzles where every room challenges your intellect. In Cube Mind, every element in the environment is more than just decoration \u2014 it\u2019s a strategic tool you must learn to master. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activators</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.poster.avif?t=1765304615\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.webm?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.mp4?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Trigger mechanisms, open doors, and reshape the level by placing cubes with precision. These smart switches react to your actions, ready to set key events in motion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boosters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.poster.avif?t=1765304615\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.webm?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.mp4?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Need to reach new heights? These kinetic modules launch cubes \u2014 and even yourself \u2014 across the environment. Learn to control their direction and power to solve puzzles with flair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Respawners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.poster.avif?t=1765304615\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.webm?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.mp4?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Never worry about losing a cube. These generators ensure you can always reset your strategy and try again without restarting the entire level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lasers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.poster.avif?t=1765304615\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.webm?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.mp4?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Energy is everything. Redirect laser beams through reflection and precise alignment to unlock new areas. A single millimeter can mean the difference between success and reset.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\ud83d\udfe2 Green Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654570/cdb9404c7fd24093e982250fa0e2f0a4c807d30c.jpg"},{"name":"\ud83d\udd35 Blue Code","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654570/e566fd9e54bd1dd86014b8e277f7aea156fa2d57.jpg"},{"name":"\ud83d\udfe3 Violet Echoes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654570/c8649032002f1ebc0acb41c7cb0ad107b3bb3abc.jpg"},{"name":"\u26aa The Cycle Closes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654570/40208b8ae1de931ebd2f54e4adeee622d325a184.jpg"},{"name":"Cube Creator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654570/b157a85979cf1de8a5e179617bb6ae6b00d8d186.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Reflection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654570/55a1c140075893ef40db940ccfc63a957025c815.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654570?t=1765304615","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/829ee5319dfbb57a986c192957547dc6d5e53f24/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765304615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/c4438ed37f4cecc023ba221141cfa20c8e686387/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765304615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/c4438ed37f4cecc023ba221141cfa20c8e686387/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765304615","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3719290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US ON DISCORD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/de313c4e2b09c32a8cbc1febf4882239.avif?t=1765304615\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get ready to enter a network of futuristic puzzles where every room challenges your intellect. In Cube Mind, every element in the environment is more than just decoration \u2014 it\u2019s a strategic tool you must learn to master. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activators</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.poster.avif?t=1765304615\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.webm?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.mp4?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Trigger mechanisms, open doors, and reshape the level by placing cubes with precision. These smart switches react to your actions, ready to set key events in motion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boosters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.poster.avif?t=1765304615\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.webm?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.mp4?t=1765304615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Need to reach new heights? These kinetic modules launch cubes \u2014 and even yourself \u2014 across the environment. Learn to control their direction and power to solve puzzles with flair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Respawners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><